+// XRd default-route injection, carried over from upstream aecdf13 (the XRd init script in CreatePod).
+// netlab's IOS-XR config and the fork's seed mount install no management default route, so the
+// first-boot config is copied from the seed volume to an emptyDir and the pod's default IPv4/IPv6
+// gateways are appended as `router static` entries before XR starts. Only upstream's entrypoint
+// call is dropped: the interface wait is the separate init-<name> container.
